# Copy this file to router-dhcp-extra.conf (gitignored) and fill in real
# values. Never commit the real router-dhcp-extra.conf.
#
# Optional - read verbatim by openwrt/dhcp.yml (via a `lookup('file', ...,
# errors='ignore')` in openwrt/files/dhcp.conf) and appended after the
# `odhcpd` section of the router's /etc/config/dhcp. Reserved for the
# router's `config domain`/`config host` static DHCP lease entries, which
# list real internal hostnames. Leave the file absent until you have
# entries to add - a missing file renders as nothing, no placeholder
# needed.
#
# Plain UCI syntax, same formatting rules as router-firewall.conf.example:
#
# config domain 'example'
# 	option name 'nas'
# 	option ip '192.168.1.50'
